      "en": "Much in every way! Because first of all, they were entrusted with the revelations of God.",
      "ko": "범사에 많으니 첫째는 저희가 하나님의 말씀을 맡았음이니라",
      "source_text_hash": "49e722f36a27b7160aa1e8b33bb5bfc581fc04117e12e434cb2e6cc3efed728a",
      "translation_text_hash": "6056addef08c16f48062d7990f1d6715384b886bfede47f9ac4f2c77972c63ee",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
