      "en": "As it is written, “There is no one righteous; no, not one.",
      "ko": "기록한바 의인은 없나니 하나도 없으며",
      "source_text_hash": "e8c661b9fa2a92a4d637899f630f9cdc97f7f797561ef612031f7a40d2448b57",
      "translation_text_hash": "aa46d1c79dcfba95ddddd53dd9326770e421d20857787b0b833a9be773ef97d6",
