      "en": "There is no one who understands. There is no one who seeks after God.",
      "ko": "깨닫는 자도 없고 하나님을 찾는 자도 없고",
      "source_text_hash": "79f2cf6e2ba240ff39a6c29ae21d942983e50cb1ce91f51973896f4829162c33",
      "translation_text_hash": "21e6e2e2a3eed7fa9e14b1b53a0a089d60d733e6aefdcb4de04c23c450374198",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
