      "en": "They have all turned away. They have together become unprofitable. There is no one who does good, no, not so much as one.”",
      "ko": "다 치우쳐 한가지로 무익하게 되고 선을 행하는 자는 없나니 하나도 없도다",
      "source_text_hash": "d97ce2cdea818b90d441a680afd8ea248402293df8a88a4ee532f4cd9e94d680",
